&lt;li&gt;Partner with &lt;strong&gt;Product&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; to influence strategic decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;AI-powered automation&lt;/strong&gt; and modern SEO workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and prioritize the &lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; based on impact, effort and business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define &lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO standards&lt;/strong&gt; across &lt;strong&gt;Crawlability&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Indexability&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Internal Linking&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Structured Data&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Core Web Vitals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with &lt;strong&gt;Product&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; to deliver scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate trade-offs between &lt;strong&gt;SEO&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;UX&lt;/strong&gt; and engineering effort&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical leadership, reviews and guidance for the Technical SEO team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive experimentation, monitoring and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in &lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO&lt;/strong&gt; for large websites, platforms or marketplaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;JavaScript SEO&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO architecture&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Core Web Vitals&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO best practices&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
