&lt;li&gt;Strong prioritization, stakeholder management and data-driven decision-making skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with &lt;strong&gt;Google Search Console&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;SEMrush, SISTRIX,&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Screaming Frog&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;GA4&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;BigQuery&lt;/strong&gt; or similar tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using &lt;strong&gt;AI-powered tools&lt;/strong&gt; to improve technical SEO workflows&lt;/li&gt;
