&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of Product Management experience, including significant experience in mobile products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous leadership experience managing or mentoring Product Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering successful mobile app products at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in agile product development environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
