&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of mobile ecosystems, user behavior, and app growth strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical skills with experience using product analytics and experimentation frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding stakeholder management and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to balance customer and commercial objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
