&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2003&quot; data-end=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;Experience troubleshooting and analyzing remotely deployed software systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;Proficiency in English and German.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;Right to work in Germany, without sponsorship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;Eligibility for German security clearances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;Self-motivated, organized, and collaborative.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
