&lt;li data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2214&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;Experience with board-level debugging and system bring-up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2212&quot; data-end=&quot;2323&quot;&gt;Familiarity with Jenkins or similar CI/CD systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
